 "notModeled": [
  "analog input (0 V to Vref, pseudo-differential), internal 4.096-V reference and buffer: the result is always the 0 V code 00000h",
  "the conversion starts at the CONVST falling edge only while CS is low; the model starts it at every CONVST falling edge regardless of CS",
  "self-clearing reset: a CONVST falling edge with CS low, or a CS falling edge, while the internal convert state is high resets the converter (output latches cleared, BUSY low) (p.23)",
  "the first three conversions after power-up load factory trim data and are invalid (p.23)",
  "read-out selection by BYTE and BUS18/16 (Table 2) is modeled with an internal register SEL fed by pins.levels and protocol.reads; the per-pin table on p.9 lists the BYTE=0/BUS18/16=1 case with D1-D0 on DB3-DB2, which Table 2 agrees with",
  "tAcc / tDf use ten / tdis 30 ns max at +VBD = 3 V (20 ns at 5 V); BYTE/BUS18/16-to-data td3 30 ns",
  "sampling start, acquisition time, quiet zone around CONVST falling (50 ns before, 40 ns after); reading during a conversion returns the previous result on the part"
 ],
